<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Candidatura recebida | GT Stone</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#162B24">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --verde-escuro: #162B24;
    --verde: #203830;
    --verde-borda: #3A5248;
    --dourado: #C0A97F;
    --dourado-hover: #D2BD94;
    --branco: #F4F4F2;
    --texto-sec: #C9D1CC;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { min-height: 100%; }
  body {
    font-family: "Montserrat", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    color: var(--branco);
    background-color: var(--verde-escuro);
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(118deg, transparent 0 46%, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 46.3%, transparent 46.8% 100%),
      linear-gradient(62deg, transparent 0 63%, rgba(192,169,127,.05) 63.2%, transparent 63.6% 100%),
      linear-gradient(140deg, transparent 0 22%, rgba(255,255,255,.025) 22.2%, transparent 22.6% 100%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 10%, #24443A 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 90%, #1D3A31 0%, transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #172E26 0%, #10231C 100%);
    background-attachment: fixed;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  main {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .logo {
    display: block;
    width: 190px;
    max-width: 60%;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
  }
  .card {
    background: rgba(32, 56, 48, .72);
    border: 1px solid var(--verde-borda);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px 28px 32px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  .check {
    width: 56px; height: 56px;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--dourado);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .check svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; stroke: var(--dourado); }
  h1 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .lead {
    color: var(--texto-sec);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .etapa {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dourado);
    border: 1px solid rgba(192,169,127,.45);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .divisor {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--verde-borda), transparent);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .instrucao {
    color: var(--texto-sec);
    font-size: .95rem;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .instrucao strong { color: var(--branco); font-weight: 600; }
  .botao {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 58px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--dourado);
    color: var(--verde-escuro);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(192,169,127,.22);
    animation: pulso 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .botao svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .botao:hover, .botao:focus-visible {
    background: var(--dourado-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    animation: none;
  }
  .botao:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--branco); outline-offset: 3px; }
  @keyframes pulso {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(192,169,127,.22), 0 0 0 0 rgba(192,169,127,.45); }
    50%      { box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(192,169,127,.22), 0 0 0 10px rgba(192,169,127,0); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .botao { animation: none; } }
  .nota {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: .82rem;
    color: var(--texto-sec);
    opacity: .85;
  }
  footer {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: .75rem;
    color: var(--texto-sec);
    opacity: .6;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    body { padding: 28px 16px; }
    .card { padding: 32px 20px 26px; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
    .logo { width: 160px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <img class="logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="GT Stone Marmoraria &amp; Superfícies" width="520" height="330">

  <section class="card">
    <div class="check" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>
    </div>

    <h1>Cadastro recebido!</h1>
    <p class="lead">Obrigado pelo interesse em fazer parte da equipe GT Stone.</p>

    <div class="divisor"></div>

    <span class="etapa">Falta só mais 1 etapa</span>
    <h2>Confirme sua candidatura no WhatsApp</h2>
    <p class="instrucao">
      Clique no botão abaixo e <strong>envie a mensagem de confirmação</strong> para o WhatsApp da nossa equipe.
      Sem essa confirmação, seu cadastro pode não ser analisado.
    </p>

    <a class="botao"
       href="https://wa.me/5547933828985?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20acabei%20de%20me%20candidatar%20a%20uma%20vaga%20de%20emprego%20na%20GT%20Stone"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-12.4 7.4L3 21l2.1-5.5A8.4 8.4 0 1 1 21 11.5z"/></svg>
      Confirmar no WhatsApp
    </a>
    <p class="nota">A mensagem já vem pronta. É só tocar em enviar.</p>
  </section>

  <footer>GT Stone · Marmoraria &amp; Superfícies</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
